g-fin-212` from main and committed the fix: changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` in `round_money`.\n3. **Ran CI** (run `ci-0001`) \u2014 status: **passed**.\n4. **Opened PR #101** against main with the code-owner as reviewer, and **merged it** after approval (\"Approved. Looks right.\"). Commit `08d3cd5986` is now on main, so the fix will be included in today's release.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Let me start by listing files and reading the relevant ones.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a145b262d1729b827ad373", "function": {"arguments": "{}", "name": "list_files"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a145b262d1729b827ad374", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"src/money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a145b262d1729b827ad375", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"tests/test_money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The test expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), but the code uses ROUND_HALF_UP. I'll create a branch with the fix.", "reasoning_content": "Note: the test expects 2.675 -> 2.68. Under ROUND_HALF_EVEN, 2.675 quantized... 2.675 half-even: the digit before is 7 (odd), so half-even rounds to 8? Wait, 2.675 -> rounding to hundredths, 2.67 vs 2.68; tie at .005, half-even rounds to even last digit: 8 is even, so 2.68. And 2.665 -> 2.66 vs 2.67, half-even rounds to 6 (even) \u2192 2.66. Good, ROUND_HALF_EVEN satisfies both.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a145b2665f74dd9255d4cf", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix/bankers-rounding-fin-212\"}", "name": "create_branch"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reas